WEBVTT

01:40.170 --> 01:43.020
[Fangs of Fortune]

01:43.120 --> 01:45.960
[Episode 2]

01:50.630 --> 01:51.490
Archivist Wen,

01:51.630 --> 01:53.430
how come you're bleeding again?

02:05.990 --> 02:07.100
I need to go out.

02:24.270 --> 02:27.000
I waited for you so long that I almost fell asleep.

02:27.110 --> 02:28.310
You knew I would come?

02:29.990 --> 02:31.980
I know you can't let it go.

02:32.430 --> 02:34.000
I can't let go of your life.

02:35.030 --> 02:37.890
You have the blood of countless lives on your hands.

02:38.150 --> 02:39.710
Even your death is not enough.

02:39.710 --> 02:41.579
So you were bound to come.

02:42.670 --> 02:46.270
Because you want to know the true way to use the Cloud Light Sword.

02:47.850 --> 02:49.250
I can tell you.

02:50.190 --> 02:51.590
But you have conditions.

02:52.950 --> 02:53.750
Yes.

02:55.870 --> 02:57.140
What do you want?

02:57.829 --> 02:59.829
I want a vow from you.

03:00.800 --> 03:02.430
Make a solemn vow.

03:03.270 --> 03:04.870
Never to go back on your word.

03:06.430 --> 03:07.440
What do you want me

03:07.910 --> 03:08.910
to do?

03:15.270 --> 03:17.030
I want you to kill me.

03:17.810 --> 03:20.870
I'll teach you the true way to use the Cloud Light Sword.

03:21.180 --> 03:22.280
Then...

03:24.390 --> 03:25.710
Kill me.

03:32.630 --> 03:33.890
You really want to die?

03:35.230 --> 03:36.070
Yes.

03:37.470 --> 03:39.740
And I must die by your hand.

03:41.990 --> 03:43.350
I don't understand.

03:43.990 --> 03:45.190
If you want to die,

03:46.070 --> 03:47.670
there are thousands of ways.

03:48.820 --> 03:50.780
Why must I be the one to kill you?

03:52.950 --> 03:55.260
People call me the evilest demon.

03:55.390 --> 03:56.940
Why do you think that is?

03:57.370 --> 03:59.190
It's obviously because you've committed numerous evil deeds.

03:59.190 --> 04:00.650
You're extremely brutal.

04:01.710 --> 04:04.440
Mr. Zhuo, don't believe those rumors.

04:04.960 --> 04:05.760
What?

04:06.510 --> 04:08.910
Don't tell me you're actually a good demon?

04:10.830 --> 04:11.630
No.

04:13.430 --> 04:15.270
I'm more vicious and eviler

04:15.940 --> 04:16.870
than rumors say.

04:17.750 --> 04:20.350
Not only do I absorb the world's malicious energy,

04:20.350 --> 04:22.910
but I'm also a vessel that contains it.

04:25.870 --> 04:27.410
Do you know what malicious energy is?

04:27.410 --> 04:28.600
Of course I do.

04:30.230 --> 04:32.030
It can destroy heaven and earth.

04:32.510 --> 04:33.770
It can make the world

04:33.790 --> 04:34.790
dark and sunless,

04:36.030 --> 04:37.690
and be littered with corpses.

04:38.030 --> 04:38.870
So,

04:39.360 --> 04:40.510
when I die,

04:41.350 --> 04:42.430
a new vessel

04:42.430 --> 04:45.300
will immediately be born in the world

04:45.909 --> 04:47.030
to replace me

04:47.030 --> 04:50.030
and contain and absorb the endless malicious energy.

04:52.390 --> 04:54.070
And that new vessel,

04:54.510 --> 04:56.320
whether good or evil,

04:56.620 --> 04:58.260
righteous or wicked,

04:58.830 --> 05:00.270
is unpredictable.

05:04.150 --> 05:05.520
Your Cloud Light Sword

05:05.950 --> 05:08.860
can dispel all evil spirits and demons.

05:09.730 --> 05:11.670
Dying by your sword

05:12.660 --> 05:15.750
can end the vessels' reincarnation cycle.

05:24.120 --> 05:25.320
I, Zhuo Yichen,

05:26.400 --> 05:27.960
swear to the heavens

05:30.170 --> 05:31.600
that as long as Zhu Yan

05:31.630 --> 05:34.780
teaches me the true use of the Cloud Light Sword,

05:35.610 --> 05:38.340
I will surely slay him with my sword.

05:39.880 --> 05:41.280
If I break this vow,

05:42.700 --> 05:44.500
may heaven and earth destroy me,

05:45.230 --> 05:46.630
and my soul be scattered.

05:50.630 --> 05:51.790
Very good.

06:05.170 --> 06:06.420
What's going on?

06:06.980 --> 06:08.240
What happened?

06:09.870 --> 06:10.460
Well...

06:10.490 --> 06:12.310
I don't know what happened either.

06:12.310 --> 06:13.670
When Commander Zhuo came just now,

06:13.670 --> 06:14.870
he was fine.

06:15.110 --> 06:16.350
Commander Zhuo was here?

06:16.350 --> 06:17.160
He just left.

06:20.870 --> 06:21.690
Open the door.

06:21.810 --> 06:22.470
Yes.

06:23.910 --> 06:25.010
Mr. Fan Ying,

06:24.000 --> 06:26.420
[Demon Hunting Bureau Meeting Hall]

06:25.110 --> 06:26.310
we need to select

06:26.310 --> 06:28.110
an elite force to lead the charge

06:28.110 --> 06:31.100
to quickly solve the Water Ghost's wedding murder case.

06:31.100 --> 06:33.710
This is the list of candidates drafted by the Prime Minister.

06:33.710 --> 06:35.270
Each of them possesses extraordinary skills

06:35.270 --> 06:36.350
and they are unwaveringly loyal.

06:36.350 --> 06:37.620
There are twenty-eight people in total.

06:37.620 --> 06:39.130
Five will suffice.

06:39.190 --> 06:39.990
Quantity over quality

06:39.990 --> 06:41.050
is useless.

06:41.670 --> 06:43.510
I have prepared five tokens.

06:44.110 --> 06:46.430
Two of them have already been handed to them.

06:44.270 --> 06:46.510
[Demon Hunting Bureau]

06:50.710 --> 06:51.700
These two

06:51.700 --> 06:54.240
are not on the Prime Minister's list.

07:45.200 --> 07:46.210
Get up.

07:46.710 --> 07:47.720
Stop pretending.

07:55.070 --> 07:57.930
I didn't expect Ms. Wen Xiao to care so much about me.

07:58.230 --> 08:00.080
I can't help but feel touched.

08:03.180 --> 08:05.380
I'm already up and you still stabbed me?

08:07.190 --> 08:08.340
Just in case.

08:08.420 --> 08:10.150
I'll give you a small cut first.

08:10.470 --> 08:12.100
There's Huanling Powder on the blade.

08:12.100 --> 08:14.160
It can suppress your demonic powers.

08:14.630 --> 08:15.580
Otherwise,

08:15.710 --> 08:17.310
I'm afraid you might hurt me.

08:17.710 --> 08:20.050
You're the one who's been hurting me.

08:21.390 --> 08:22.950
Humans and demons should keep their distance.

08:22.950 --> 08:24.350
Why are you here to see me?

08:24.630 --> 08:25.560
I'm here

08:25.630 --> 08:26.790
to give you a gift.

08:30.390 --> 08:32.990
It seems Mr. Fan Ying has accepted my proposal.

08:34.190 --> 08:35.880
It'll be impolite not to reciprocate.

08:35.880 --> 08:37.700
I'm a very polite person.

08:37.990 --> 08:38.809
Tell me,

08:39.190 --> 08:40.350
what do you want?

08:41.030 --> 08:42.190
I want an answer.

08:43.429 --> 08:44.600
What did

08:44.950 --> 08:46.550
Zhuo come to see you for?

08:55.390 --> 08:57.200
Why do you care so much about him?

08:58.030 --> 09:00.870
He's just an ordinary mortal man.

09:03.630 --> 09:04.470
Zhuo

09:04.470 --> 09:06.280
is no ordinary man.

09:06.590 --> 09:07.810
Zhuo?

09:08.190 --> 09:09.350
Zhuo.

09:18.870 --> 09:19.830
What's going on?

09:20.190 --> 09:21.850
Are you going to tell me or not?

09:22.910 --> 09:25.470
This is an agreement between Commander Zhuo and me.

09:25.470 --> 09:26.620
It's a secret.

09:27.110 --> 09:29.000
How can I easily tell others?

09:29.590 --> 09:30.550
Others?

09:31.190 --> 09:32.600
Mr. Zhao Yuanzhou,

09:32.670 --> 09:34.110
you specifically named me

09:34.110 --> 09:35.600
to hunt demons together.

09:35.940 --> 09:37.700
Now you call me

09:37.830 --> 09:38.780
'others'?

09:40.070 --> 09:40.870
That's right.

09:41.370 --> 09:43.100
You're not happy about

09:43.840 --> 09:45.170
hunting demons with me?

09:45.500 --> 09:46.470
Not happy.

09:47.710 --> 09:48.990
Mortal women

09:48.990 --> 09:50.790
all say one thing and mean another.

09:50.790 --> 09:53.260
You seem to know a lot about mortal women.

09:53.310 --> 09:55.040
I know a thing or two, I suppose.

09:55.270 --> 09:57.670
Don't you also carry a pen and notebook every day

09:57.670 --> 09:59.550
to study us demons of the Wilderness?

09:59.550 --> 10:00.350
You and I,

10:00.610 --> 10:02.210
we're not so different.

10:02.920 --> 10:05.580
How much have you been snooping around about me?

10:08.120 --> 10:10.320
If I hadn't specifically requested it,

10:10.790 --> 10:12.910
I'm afraid with your weak and frail

10:13.030 --> 10:15.110
body that could be blown over by the wind,

10:15.110 --> 10:18.110
you'd never make it into the Demon Hunting Squad in your lifetime.

10:18.110 --> 10:20.150
When did I ever say I wanted to join?

10:20.150 --> 10:20.910
See?

10:21.350 --> 10:22.110
See?

10:22.550 --> 10:24.720
The storybooks were right after all.

10:24.870 --> 10:25.770
Women

10:25.910 --> 10:28.040
always say one thing and mean another.

10:28.550 --> 10:29.550
Before I came here,

10:29.550 --> 10:31.410
I had already inquired about you.

10:31.670 --> 10:34.400
Ms. Wen Xiao is dedicated to helping demons,

10:34.660 --> 10:36.770
secretly releasing demons many times

10:36.770 --> 10:38.980
from under the nose of Chongwu Camp.

10:39.390 --> 10:40.460
You always say

10:40.460 --> 10:42.090
people can be good or bad,

10:42.310 --> 10:44.230
and demons can be righteous or evil,

10:44.230 --> 10:45.020
right?

10:46.150 --> 10:47.960
And haven't you already

10:48.160 --> 10:50.290
eagerly accepted the token?

10:49.250 --> 10:50.020
[[Demon Hunting Bureau]]

10:51.380 --> 10:53.310
Yet you still say you don't want it?

10:55.270 --> 10:56.870
You're so impressive.

10:57.410 --> 10:58.890
You know so much.

11:00.510 --> 11:01.560
I also know

11:01.600 --> 11:04.200
that you're the disciple of the Baize Goddess.

11:08.990 --> 11:10.650
What's so special about that?

11:12.030 --> 11:13.850
All the demons in the Wilderness

11:14.020 --> 11:16.630
know that I'm the new Baize Goddess.

11:17.590 --> 11:18.850
If we're talking about

11:19.680 --> 11:21.470
fame in the Wilderness,

11:24.750 --> 11:26.930
I'm no less famous than you, Zhu Yan.

11:28.590 --> 11:30.130
A goddess without the Baize Token

11:30.130 --> 11:32.150
or Baize Divine Power

11:32.710 --> 11:34.190
is indeed very famous.

11:36.270 --> 11:39.010
A well-known laughingstock.

11:42.310 --> 11:44.210
If your master Zhao Wan'er

11:44.520 --> 11:46.730
saw you as you are today,

11:47.870 --> 11:50.070
would she be disappointed?

12:07.960 --> 12:10.200
I love swinging on a swing the most.

12:12.510 --> 12:14.430
I hate pushing swings the most.

12:22.670 --> 12:24.440
Have we met before or not?

12:28.710 --> 12:29.760
You've already

12:30.630 --> 12:32.170
asked this question once.

12:33.390 --> 12:35.190
Then come closer and look again.

12:35.590 --> 12:36.850
Make sure.

12:49.850 --> 12:50.990
Do you know why your body

12:50.990 --> 12:52.650
is so weak?

12:53.450 --> 12:55.450
Because the Baize Token is missing.

12:56.960 --> 12:57.870
I know.

12:59.020 --> 13:00.420
You don't need to tell me.

13:01.120 --> 13:02.310
Then do you know

13:03.020 --> 13:04.830
that if you can't find it back,

13:05.750 --> 13:08.020
you'll die soon?

13:14.790 --> 13:17.290
It seems your master didn't tell you.

13:18.970 --> 13:20.050
Now,

13:20.350 --> 13:22.310
you have no divine power.

13:22.690 --> 13:24.680
Unless you find the Baize Token,

13:25.030 --> 13:27.810
you'll soon die of weakness.

13:28.650 --> 13:30.130
I can help you.

13:32.270 --> 13:34.070
I came here from the Wilderness

13:35.280 --> 13:38.060
to help you find the Baize Token.

13:39.940 --> 13:41.560
In this situation,

13:41.900 --> 13:43.630
we can cooperate for mutual benefit

13:43.630 --> 13:44.910
and get what we need.

13:45.110 --> 13:46.110
Isn't that good?

13:48.110 --> 13:49.720
I do need the Baize Token.

13:51.690 --> 13:52.550
What about you?

13:54.010 --> 13:55.680
What do you want?

13:56.810 --> 13:58.760
I also want the Baize Token.

13:59.190 --> 14:01.310
What do you want the Baize Token for?

14:01.380 --> 14:03.510
Because the goddess hasn't returned.

14:04.530 --> 14:05.590
If this continues,

14:07.190 --> 14:08.990
the Wilderness will be done for.

14:10.790 --> 14:12.260
After Zhao Wan'er's death,

14:11.940 --> 14:15.630
[One month ago]

14:12.320 --> 14:14.080
the position of Goddess of the Wilderness has been vacant.

14:14.080 --> 14:15.750
Without the protective power,

14:15.750 --> 14:17.580
powerful and brutal demons

14:17.910 --> 14:19.830
break through the Kunlun Gate

14:20.150 --> 14:21.610
and enter the human world.

14:28.630 --> 14:30.350
If Baize doesn't return,

14:30.380 --> 14:32.110
the Wilderness will perish.

14:33.110 --> 14:34.080
Zhu Yan,

14:34.630 --> 14:36.110
the past has already been bid farewell

14:36.110 --> 14:37.790
and old friends have departed.

14:37.790 --> 14:40.110
Don't be a distant boat in the sea of bitterness,

14:40.110 --> 14:41.790
imprisoning yourself.

14:42.110 --> 14:43.390
Find the goddess

14:43.410 --> 14:45.070
and retrieve the Baize Token.

14:45.270 --> 14:46.290
This is

14:46.310 --> 14:48.850
your last chance for redemption.

15:07.940 --> 15:11.370
The water ghost bride abduction case that your adoptive father wants to investigate

15:11.370 --> 15:13.190
also stemmed from this.

15:16.350 --> 15:18.220
I once made a vow

15:18.790 --> 15:20.320
to protect the Wilderness,

15:21.720 --> 15:24.580
bring back the demons who fled from the Wilderness,

15:27.000 --> 15:29.060
and restore peace to the human world.

15:36.750 --> 15:38.480
I'm speaking so passionately.

15:39.510 --> 15:41.170
What's with your expression?

15:42.050 --> 15:43.610
Your acting is so fake.

15:43.790 --> 15:44.790
Tone it down a bit.

15:46.390 --> 15:47.190
Okay.

15:49.430 --> 15:50.910
Everyone knows

15:51.390 --> 15:52.850
that when Zhu Yan appears,

15:52.910 --> 15:54.060
chaos will erupt.

15:55.470 --> 15:57.750
Eight years ago, you massacred the Demon Hunting Bureau,

15:57.750 --> 15:59.280
killing countless people.

15:59.390 --> 16:00.150
Among them

16:00.150 --> 16:02.180
were Zhuo's father and brother.

16:03.790 --> 16:04.640
You

16:04.870 --> 16:06.590
are full of malicious energy

16:06.910 --> 16:08.260
and brimming with evil.

16:09.110 --> 16:11.810
You don't seem like a demon with such a

16:11.840 --> 16:13.580
sense of responsibility

16:14.720 --> 16:15.510
and justice.

16:16.950 --> 16:17.790
Is that so?

16:19.670 --> 16:21.550
Is that what everyone thinks?

16:24.870 --> 16:26.790
If even you think this way...

16:29.870 --> 16:30.390
Yes.

16:30.390 --> 16:33.050
Then I can only cooperate with the Chongwu Camp.

16:46.440 --> 16:47.990
Your words can't threaten me.

16:47.990 --> 16:49.650
You can't threaten me either.

16:52.120 --> 16:54.060
Let's just stay at this impasse.

16:54.550 --> 16:55.750
One word:

16:56.340 --> 16:57.270
wait.

17:02.350 --> 17:05.040
I won't fall into the same trap twice.

17:05.349 --> 17:07.450
You think I'd let you get close to me again?

17:07.450 --> 17:08.579
How about this then?

17:09.109 --> 17:11.130
No matter what evil intentions you harbor,

17:11.130 --> 17:13.230
your purpose for coming to the Demon Hunting Bureau

17:13.230 --> 17:14.579
was to find me.

17:15.510 --> 17:17.010
If I die,

17:17.329 --> 17:19.230
your plans will all fail.

17:19.310 --> 17:19.790
Move.

17:28.040 --> 17:29.950
Whoever I want to die

17:31.110 --> 17:33.040
cannot possibly live.

17:34.790 --> 17:35.850
Conversely,

17:36.520 --> 17:38.480
those I want to live

17:40.680 --> 17:43.350
cannot possibly die in front of me.

17:49.510 --> 17:50.590
Live well.

17:52.000 --> 17:52.910
At least,

17:54.710 --> 17:57.360
your master hopes you live well.

18:16.740 --> 18:17.550
Sir,

18:17.670 --> 18:19.330
Mr. Fan has sent three tokens.

18:23.710 --> 18:28.300
[Demon Hunting Bureau]

18:27.190 --> 18:30.120
Once you select the final two people,

18:30.150 --> 18:32.150
I will issue the official document

18:32.150 --> 18:36.350
to announce the completion of the Demon Hunting Bureau's reconstruction.

18:37.230 --> 18:39.220
[Demon Hunting Bureau]

18:39.640 --> 18:41.170
Pei Sijing.

18:48.440 --> 18:51.400
[Pei Sijing]

18:53.090 --> 18:55.700
[Bai Jiu]

18:57.160 --> 18:58.340
Bai Jiu!

18:58.840 --> 19:02.800
[Jixin Clinic]

19:05.270 --> 19:06.930
Take this to get the medicine.

19:07.160 --> 19:10.420
The first elite vanguard squad will depart immediately

19:10.450 --> 19:11.950
to replace the Chongwu Camp

19:11.950 --> 19:14.810
and take over the water ghost bride abduction case.

19:22.540 --> 19:25.000
I specially brought pastries from Qingfeng Restaurant.

19:25.000 --> 19:26.660
They're your favorite, Zhuo.

19:33.390 --> 19:35.250
[Demon Hunting Bureau]

19:36.320 --> 19:40.040
Do you really have to join the Demon Hunting Bureau's vanguard squad?

19:40.040 --> 19:41.110
Isn't it good?

19:41.580 --> 19:42.620
Of course not.

19:43.150 --> 19:44.410
The demons are vicious

19:44.910 --> 19:46.240
and it's too dangerous.

19:47.310 --> 19:48.390
With you here,

19:48.470 --> 19:49.670
what do I have to fear?

19:50.030 --> 19:51.430
You'll protect me.

19:54.210 --> 19:56.030
I will definitely protect you.

19:57.000 --> 19:58.000
It's just that...

19:59.590 --> 20:00.920
For many years,

20:01.630 --> 20:04.030
we have been searching for the Baize Token.

20:04.450 --> 20:05.840
We worked for so long

20:05.880 --> 20:07.120
but have no clues.

20:08.030 --> 20:09.590
Now that Zhu Yan has appeared,

20:09.590 --> 20:10.880
and is willing to help,

20:11.160 --> 20:12.690
it is a great opportunity.

20:13.120 --> 20:14.450
Do you believe him?

20:15.740 --> 20:17.090
He's the evilest demon.

20:17.230 --> 20:18.760
Of course I don't trust him.

20:23.070 --> 20:24.670
But I always feel

20:25.620 --> 20:27.940
he seems like an old friend of my master.

20:30.310 --> 20:31.920
Can't you give me a push?

20:33.150 --> 20:33.950
No.

20:34.620 --> 20:35.680
How old are you now?

20:37.470 --> 20:39.730
I can't swing just because I've grown up?

20:41.160 --> 20:41.780
Master told you

20:41.780 --> 20:43.040
to take care of me.

21:13.030 --> 21:14.300
If it's him,

21:14.980 --> 21:17.130
he might really know the whereabouts of the Baize Token.

21:17.130 --> 21:18.170
Impossible.

21:18.430 --> 21:21.750
Zhu Yan killed so many people from the Demon Hunting Bureau back then.

21:21.750 --> 21:23.610
Your master is the Baize Goddess.

21:24.780 --> 21:27.580
How could she possibly be old friends with Zhu Yan?

21:29.670 --> 21:30.830
You're so young.

21:31.190 --> 21:33.920
Don't always have such a precocious expression.

21:33.950 --> 21:35.670
I'll be 24 next month.

21:35.670 --> 21:37.810
Even if you were 42, I'd still be your aunt.

21:37.810 --> 21:38.470
I...

21:53.880 --> 21:55.130
I know.

21:56.440 --> 21:58.900
You can't get over that hurdle in your heart.

21:59.670 --> 22:02.260
He's the one who killed your father and brother,

22:02.260 --> 22:04.490
yet you have to fight alongside him

22:04.830 --> 22:06.630
and interact with him every day.

22:06.990 --> 22:09.580
I'm letting down the spirits of my father and brother.

22:09.580 --> 22:11.840
But to protect the Demon Hunting Bureau,

22:12.520 --> 22:14.600
you still agreed, didn't you?

22:15.850 --> 22:17.730
This is your ancestral home,

22:18.380 --> 22:20.320
the home you grew up in.

22:21.200 --> 22:22.670
You were willing to donate it

22:22.670 --> 22:24.490
to rebuild the Demon Hunting Bureau.

22:24.490 --> 22:25.470
Can't you just...

22:25.470 --> 22:27.330
After my father and brother died,

22:27.790 --> 22:30.520
this place became just an empty, desolate house.

22:33.710 --> 22:34.800
Not a home.

22:35.910 --> 22:38.380
I lived here alone in a daze,

22:39.150 --> 22:40.370
wasting my time.

22:43.780 --> 22:44.900
Eight years ago,

22:46.100 --> 22:47.640
I already lost my home.

22:51.900 --> 22:54.480
Now that the people from the Demon Hunting Bureau are here,

22:54.480 --> 22:55.890
there's more life here.

22:56.430 --> 22:58.360
It's actually better than before.

23:00.070 --> 23:01.310
For generations, the Zhuo family

23:01.310 --> 23:04.070
has been full of people with a sense of righteousness.

23:04.070 --> 23:05.230
Temporarily working with your enemy

23:05.230 --> 23:06.630
for the sake of investigating the case,

23:06.630 --> 23:08.480
for the Baize Token,

23:08.790 --> 23:10.650
they will surely understand you.

23:11.390 --> 23:12.590
They won't blame you.

23:14.950 --> 23:16.270
Actually, I agreed to him

23:16.270 --> 23:18.730
joining the Demon Hunting Squad because...

23:21.030 --> 23:21.750
What?

23:27.270 --> 23:28.110
Mr. Fan.

23:28.590 --> 23:29.430
Zhuo,

23:30.020 --> 23:32.090
do you know that your ancestor, Bingyi,

23:32.090 --> 23:34.370
once destroyed the evil demon Yinglong?

23:34.630 --> 23:35.420
Yes, I know.

23:35.560 --> 23:38.190
Yinglong had the divine power to glimpse the future.

23:38.190 --> 23:39.390
He once predicted

23:39.480 --> 23:42.270
that every successor of Bingyi who inherited the Cloud Light Sword

23:42.270 --> 23:44.940
would slay the evilest demon of their time.

23:45.520 --> 23:46.720
Yinglong's prophecy

23:46.720 --> 23:48.070
seems to be wrong.

23:49.510 --> 23:50.590
I can't kill him.

23:50.720 --> 23:51.690
No.

23:51.870 --> 23:54.470
Yinglong's prophecies have never been wrong.

23:54.830 --> 23:56.430
Because it's not a prophecy.

23:56.990 --> 23:58.190
It's a curse.

24:01.810 --> 24:02.910
Slaying Zhu Yan

24:02.910 --> 24:04.420
is my mission.

24:05.470 --> 24:07.400
If this is also considered a curse,

24:09.310 --> 24:10.910
then I couldn't ask for more.

24:16.810 --> 24:17.890
It's nothing.

24:19.750 --> 24:20.550
Oh, right.

24:20.950 --> 24:24.010
Why did you go to the dungeon alone to see Zhao Yuanzhou?

24:28.850 --> 24:30.710
You and Zhao Yuanzhou...

24:32.510 --> 24:33.970
There's something wrong.

24:35.520 --> 24:37.070
We have a secret.

24:37.190 --> 24:37.950
You

24:38.210 --> 24:40.070
are the one with something wrong.

25:02.300 --> 25:03.070
Hey.

25:03.990 --> 25:05.120
What a coincidence.

25:08.990 --> 25:10.320
You're indeed a monkey.

25:17.190 --> 25:20.040
Although your Demon Hunting Bureau looks poor,

25:21.470 --> 25:22.940
it's quite spacious.

25:23.050 --> 25:24.350
You can work in the front

25:24.350 --> 25:25.550
and live in the back.

25:25.590 --> 25:26.870
Food and lodging are provided too.

25:26.870 --> 25:29.470
Saves me the trouble of finding a place to stay.

25:29.750 --> 25:31.200
How did he get released?

25:32.680 --> 25:34.740
Wasn't a Demon Hunting Squad formed?

25:36.330 --> 25:38.260
I was afraid you'd leave me behind,

25:38.600 --> 25:39.930
so I followed you.

25:40.480 --> 25:41.940
You actually followed me?

25:42.630 --> 25:43.810
Shameless.

25:44.190 --> 25:46.320
Isn't Mr. Zhuo eager to solve the case?

25:46.670 --> 25:48.330
I'm helping everyone save time.

25:48.330 --> 25:50.090
Isn't that good?

25:50.590 --> 25:52.250
How many are we still missing?

25:54.750 --> 25:56.150
We're still missing two.

25:56.210 --> 25:56.830
As it happens, they are

25:56.830 --> 25:59.560
the two types of people I'm worst at dealing with.

26:00.410 --> 26:01.340
Which two types?

26:03.020 --> 26:03.990
One is a woman.

26:04.890 --> 26:06.130
The other is a child.

26:06.510 --> 26:07.590
Leave it to me.

26:08.080 --> 26:11.000
[Jixin Clinic]

26:16.910 --> 26:18.390
Thirteen years old?

26:20.790 --> 26:22.910
He probably can't even reach my knee, right?

26:22.910 --> 26:24.070
Is he capable?

26:25.590 --> 26:28.450
I don't want to find another one who'll hold us back.

26:28.770 --> 26:29.510
Another?

26:36.150 --> 26:37.710
Explain yourself.

26:38.230 --> 26:39.630
She's getting agitated.

26:40.530 --> 26:42.010
Although he's young,

26:42.560 --> 26:45.760
he's a renowned miracle doctor in the capital and beyond.

26:45.950 --> 26:47.750
He can diagnose not only humans,

26:47.980 --> 26:49.240
but also demons.

26:51.470 --> 26:52.190
Oh.

26:52.800 --> 26:53.600
Come back.

26:58.110 --> 26:59.540
You have signs of life,

26:59.570 --> 27:02.440
but according to the Huangzhong technique, your pulse level should be at nine.

27:02.440 --> 27:04.110
Why is yours only at one?

27:06.270 --> 27:07.280
Unless...

27:08.070 --> 27:09.460
You're not human?

27:13.460 --> 27:15.230
Your medical skills are indeed impressive.

27:15.230 --> 27:15.580
You!

27:15.610 --> 27:16.940
You... Get out of my way!

27:16.950 --> 27:18.650
This silver needle of mine is very powerful.

27:18.650 --> 27:21.180
It can slay demons and exorcise evil spirits.

27:29.010 --> 27:31.180
[Demon Hunting Bureau]

27:29.190 --> 27:30.310
He's gone.

27:35.750 --> 27:37.470
Demon Hunting Bureau's token?

27:37.470 --> 27:38.630
Little Bai Jiu,

27:39.310 --> 27:40.510
I know

27:40.530 --> 27:41.740
you don't want to.

27:42.360 --> 27:43.070
But

27:43.070 --> 27:45.100
-If I tell you...
-Who said I don’t want to?

27:45.100 --> 27:46.310
I'm so happy!

27:46.350 --> 27:47.710
I've really been chosen!

27:47.710 --> 27:48.220
Mom,

27:48.220 --> 27:49.350
I've made it!

28:10.820 --> 28:12.230
Again!

28:12.260 --> 28:13.160
Come on.

28:13.190 --> 28:15.500
Come on.

28:15.520 --> 28:17.140
Come on.

28:17.170 --> 28:18.590
Come on.

28:18.610 --> 28:19.710
Come on.

28:19.740 --> 28:21.370
Come on.

29:42.030 --> 29:43.140
Who are you?

29:43.910 --> 29:45.480
What did you do to them?

29:45.850 --> 29:46.870
Ms. Pei,

29:47.360 --> 29:49.290
I'm from the Demon Hunting Bureau.

29:49.390 --> 29:50.270
I'm Wen Xiao.

29:52.850 --> 29:54.710
Interested in a chat?

29:54.940 --> 29:55.740
No.

29:56.280 --> 29:58.080
Wake them up quickly,

29:58.340 --> 30:00.540
or don't blame me for being impolite.

30:03.370 --> 30:04.980
What are you doing?

30:06.840 --> 30:09.440
I've never seen such an absurd assassin as you.

30:13.190 --> 30:14.180
Ms. Pei,

30:15.230 --> 30:15.960
one month ago

30:16.990 --> 30:18.230
at the foot of Kunlun Mountain,

30:18.230 --> 30:20.140
a demon massacred a village.

30:20.370 --> 30:22.630
You were ordered to eliminate the demon.

30:22.820 --> 30:25.280
It should have been a merit worthy of reward,

30:25.430 --> 30:27.020
but because of this case,

30:27.020 --> 30:28.630
you were deeply affected

30:30.150 --> 30:32.010
and lost your military position.

30:32.790 --> 30:34.110
In Chongwu Camp,

30:34.110 --> 30:35.710
rumors spread.

30:38.150 --> 30:39.350
You investigated me.

30:41.920 --> 30:44.320
You've always been unable to find closure,

30:44.760 --> 30:46.420
because

30:47.360 --> 30:48.690
you couldn't be certain

30:48.720 --> 30:51.120
whether what you killed with your own hands

30:52.630 --> 30:53.870
was truly a demon

30:54.460 --> 30:55.670
or a human.

30:59.240 --> 31:00.390
That's right.

31:01.420 --> 31:04.150
That's why I resigned from my official position.

31:04.710 --> 31:07.970
It was to avoid getting involved in demonic affairs again.

31:10.100 --> 31:12.680
Don't you want to clear up your confusion?

31:14.500 --> 31:15.950
I've investigated

31:17.200 --> 31:18.440
but found nothing.

31:20.290 --> 31:21.320
We all

31:22.830 --> 31:24.170
can help you.

31:28.030 --> 31:29.240
You all?

31:39.140 --> 31:39.930
Break.

32:14.640 --> 32:15.350
Us.

32:16.710 --> 32:17.870
But mainly me.

32:20.230 --> 32:20.830
She

32:21.970 --> 32:23.190
can't be relied upon.

32:25.580 --> 32:27.180
If I couldn't find anything,

32:27.980 --> 32:29.580
what makes you think you can?

32:38.110 --> 32:39.670
Isn't it obvious enough?

32:40.690 --> 32:42.110
I'm a demon.

32:42.710 --> 32:44.440
Things that humans don't know,

32:45.910 --> 32:47.100
I know.

32:48.390 --> 32:50.050
About your brother's matter,

32:50.830 --> 32:52.140
I know that too.

33:01.880 --> 33:03.320
[Demon Hunting Bureau]

33:03.550 --> 33:04.750
Since we're here...

33:05.410 --> 33:07.490
[Demon Hunting Bureau]

33:08.830 --> 33:10.390
It's the Spring Festival.

33:25.570 --> 33:30.330
[Demon Hunting Bureau]

33:40.680 --> 33:41.670
Open.

33:54.170 --> 33:56.170
So this is the Demon Hunting Bureau?

34:05.060 --> 34:06.710
I wonder if I'll see him

34:07.310 --> 34:08.800
after I go in.

34:09.070 --> 34:09.920
Kid,

34:10.030 --> 34:11.639
who do you want to see?

34:13.060 --> 34:14.300
Why is it you again?

34:14.790 --> 34:15.630
How come

34:15.630 --> 34:17.560
you walk without making any sound?

34:18.070 --> 34:19.520
Stop dawdling.

34:19.710 --> 34:20.770
Just go in already.

34:21.500 --> 34:22.760
You don't understand.

34:24.710 --> 34:25.980
Haven't you heard?

34:26.400 --> 34:27.989
Inside the Demon Hunting Bureau, there's

34:27.989 --> 34:29.520
a thousand-year-old demon

34:29.590 --> 34:30.710
with a green face and fangs.

34:30.710 --> 34:31.860
It's ugly in appearance,

34:31.860 --> 34:32.980
and it even eats people.

34:32.980 --> 34:33.889
Nonsense!

34:35.750 --> 34:37.409
How could it possibly be ugly?

34:37.429 --> 34:38.520
It's true!

34:38.750 --> 34:40.550
I saw it with my own eyes.

34:40.980 --> 34:41.500
At that time,

34:41.500 --> 34:44.270
many experts from the Demon Hunting Bureau fell to the ground,

34:44.270 --> 34:45.639
leaving only me.

34:45.820 --> 34:47.170
I was terrified then,

34:47.199 --> 34:48.679
but I still bravely went up

34:48.710 --> 34:50.840
and fought fiercely with that Zhu Yan.

34:51.070 --> 34:52.400
In the end, I can only say

34:52.750 --> 34:54.080
it was a narrow victory.

34:55.030 --> 34:56.909
Otherwise, why do you think the Demon Hunting Bureau would choose me

34:56.909 --> 34:59.110
to join the first elite squad?

34:59.750 --> 35:00.710
Bai Jiu.

35:01.870 --> 35:02.780
Hello.

35:09.550 --> 35:10.740
Don't look down on me because of my short stature.

35:10.740 --> 35:12.670
That's because I'm only 13 years old.

35:12.670 --> 35:14.790
Don't underestimate me because of my young age.

35:14.790 --> 35:15.790
I'm very capable.

35:17.590 --> 35:19.420
Since Commander Zhuo chose you,

35:19.670 --> 35:20.750
it means

35:20.840 --> 35:22.790
you must have some exceptional qualities.

35:22.790 --> 35:24.400
Mr. Zhuo chose me?

35:26.190 --> 35:28.030
The hero I admire chose me.

35:28.390 --> 35:28.990
Let's go.

35:29.220 --> 35:31.080
I'll take you to meet Mr. Zhuo.

35:32.990 --> 35:34.590
Thank you.

35:34.830 --> 35:36.390
You're so kind.

35:38.070 --> 35:39.630
What's wrong with you, Great Demon?

35:39.630 --> 35:40.690
Why are you so late?

35:41.430 --> 35:42.230
Great Demon?

35:43.070 --> 35:43.910
Where?

35:45.310 --> 35:45.870
Him.

35:46.390 --> 35:47.120
Great Demon.

35:47.470 --> 35:48.310
Zhu Yan.

35:49.030 --> 35:50.890
So you're the Great Demon Zhu Yan?

36:19.400 --> 36:20.470
Let me go.

36:22.560 --> 36:24.100
Put me down!

36:33.390 --> 36:35.080
You don't need to be so afraid.

36:35.150 --> 36:36.270
Zhao Yuanzhou

36:36.270 --> 36:37.470
is just unserious.

36:37.470 --> 36:38.870
He likes to scare people.

36:39.390 --> 36:40.930
He doesn't eat children.

36:41.870 --> 36:43.030
Isn't he that

36:43.050 --> 36:44.690
extremely hungry demon?

36:44.790 --> 36:45.630
If he's so hungry,

36:45.630 --> 36:47.430
how can he resist eating people?

36:56.620 --> 36:58.570
He must be Mr. Zhuo Yichen.

36:58.770 --> 37:00.000
The thing in his hand

37:00.030 --> 37:01.190
is the legendary

37:01.190 --> 37:03.250
Cloud Light Sword of the Bingyi Clan.

37:07.620 --> 37:09.910
Aren't all demons afraid of this sword?

37:10.480 --> 37:12.610
Even Great Demons must fear it, right?

37:19.730 --> 37:20.530
Hello.

37:23.350 --> 37:24.070
Hello.

37:33.710 --> 37:34.310
Ms. Pei,

37:34.310 --> 37:35.150
you're here.

37:35.830 --> 37:37.020
Let me introduce you.

37:37.020 --> 37:38.350
This is the new doctor,

37:38.370 --> 37:38.970
Bai Jiu.

37:42.030 --> 37:42.980
Hello, Sister.

37:43.050 --> 37:45.180
Please take good care of me from now on.

37:52.560 --> 37:53.860
Fully draw the bow.

37:53.460 --> 37:55.670
♫An arrow in the hand♫

37:54.610 --> 37:55.740
Steady your breath.

37:56.290 --> 37:58.580
♫A string in the heart♫

37:58.390 --> 37:59.270
Hello, Sister.

37:59.210 --> 38:04.550
♫A backside standing, turning into forever♫

38:01.950 --> 38:03.230
From now on,

38:03.230 --> 38:04.760
please take good care of me.

38:04.810 --> 38:07.060
♫The moon shines on the south♫

38:07.650 --> 38:09.960
♫But I look north♫

38:10.490 --> 38:15.570
♫I only hope the snow comes a bit later♫

38:18.230 --> 38:19.490
Don't misunderstand.

38:20.130 --> 38:21.820
I'm not here to join you.

38:22.960 --> 38:24.800
I'm here to return this token.

38:25.910 --> 38:27.910
I don't believe the words of an

38:29.080 --> 38:30.520
extremely evil demon.

38:31.530 --> 38:33.270
It's right not to believe him.

38:34.020 --> 38:36.140
People from the Demon Hunting Bureau,

38:36.140 --> 38:36.910
come out.

38:40.890 --> 38:46.040
♫Heartlessness births a dream♫

38:46.130 --> 38:49.310
♫The dawn stings without hesitation♫

38:49.350 --> 38:52.340
♫The world and universe sing for me♫

38:52.380 --> 38:53.820
♫Spring, summer, autumn, winter; everything becomes nothing♫

38:53.920 --> 38:58.700
♫Heartlessness births a dream♫

39:06.470 --> 39:08.740
Mr. Zhuo, you're so imposing and powerful now.

39:08.740 --> 39:11.570
I'm afraid you've forgotten the pain once the wound has healed.

39:11.570 --> 39:14.790
Back then, the Demon Hunting Bureau was destroyed by Zhu Yan.

39:14.790 --> 39:16.660
It was the Chongwu Camp that took on the dangerous mission

39:16.660 --> 39:18.120
and protected the people.

39:19.290 --> 39:19.980
What?

39:20.930 --> 39:22.010
You forgot?

39:23.060 --> 39:25.660
The Chongwu Camp is ruthless and vicious

39:25.710 --> 39:26.950
in demon hunting.

39:26.970 --> 39:28.680
You even harm innocent lives.

39:28.710 --> 39:29.990
It goes against the law.

39:29.990 --> 39:33.170
The Chongwu Camp should have been stopped from acting arbitrarily long ago.

39:33.170 --> 39:34.960
Demons are inherently violent.

39:34.960 --> 39:36.310
To eliminate future troubles,

39:36.310 --> 39:38.870
it's better to kill a wrong one than to let one go.

39:38.870 --> 39:41.480
The Chongwu Camp privately built an underground black market,

39:41.480 --> 39:43.320
trading demon beast furs and bones,

39:43.320 --> 39:44.920
making exorbitant profits.

39:45.400 --> 39:47.200
And in the name of demon hunting,

39:47.750 --> 39:48.870
you forcibly recruit able-bodied men

39:48.870 --> 39:50.400
and occupy civilian homes.

39:50.570 --> 39:52.890
Does King Xiang know about all of this?

40:05.090 --> 40:06.470
Mr. Zhen Mei,

40:06.910 --> 40:08.150
we're in broad daylight

40:08.150 --> 40:09.560
and in full view of everyone,

40:09.560 --> 40:11.680
You're not planning to commit murder and arson, are you?

40:11.680 --> 40:14.430
The Demon Hunting Bureau has fallen into disrepair.

40:14.430 --> 40:15.870
The weather is hot and dry,

40:15.870 --> 40:17.360
which caused a wildfire.

40:18.150 --> 40:19.950
What does that have to do with me?

40:36.430 --> 40:38.060
Have you asked my permission

40:38.190 --> 40:40.790
before burning down the Demon Hunting Bureau?

40:41.450 --> 40:42.970
What do you think you are?

40:44.060 --> 40:44.900
Demon.

40:45.110 --> 40:45.860
Demon?

40:47.390 --> 40:49.250
Then you deserve to die even more.

40:52.720 --> 40:53.480
Reverse.

40:56.490 --> 40:57.730
I forgot to tell you,

40:58.550 --> 40:59.910
I'm the type of demon

40:59.910 --> 41:02.510
that likes to kill people to vent my anger.

41:04.780 --> 41:05.980
Zhao Yuanzhou,

41:06.100 --> 41:07.550
calm down.

41:08.940 --> 41:10.100
Mr. Fan.

41:12.420 --> 41:13.920
Spare them.

41:14.250 --> 41:15.230
General Wu,

41:15.830 --> 41:17.030
what brings you here?

41:17.800 --> 41:20.330
Mr. Fan said he prepared a gift for King Xiang.

41:20.450 --> 41:22.450
I came personally to receive it

41:22.520 --> 41:24.210
on behalf of King Xiang.

41:28.670 --> 41:30.050
Over the past eight years,

41:30.050 --> 41:32.320
close to 700 innocent people have been killed by the Chongwu Camp

41:32.320 --> 41:33.580
while hunting demons.

41:33.720 --> 41:36.430
The list and related evidence are all here.

41:37.010 --> 41:38.730
Please review them, General.

41:53.680 --> 41:55.320
I accept this

41:56.590 --> 41:58.520
grand gift on behalf of King Xiang.

41:58.960 --> 42:00.110
He now understands

42:00.110 --> 42:02.830
the Demon Hunting Bureau's determination to revitalize itself.

42:02.830 --> 42:04.880
He agrees for you to take over from the Chongwu Camp

42:04.880 --> 42:08.080
and thoroughly investigate the Water Ghost murder case.

42:08.430 --> 42:10.770
The Demon Hunting Bureau hereby requests permission from King Xiang

42:10.770 --> 42:12.370
to thoroughly investigate the Water Ghost murder case.

42:12.370 --> 42:13.980
Do not harm civilians.

42:14.010 --> 42:15.500
Do not be negligent or lazy.

42:15.500 --> 42:17.670
The Demon Hunting Bureau should spare no effort

42:17.670 --> 42:19.310
to solve this case.

42:19.470 --> 42:20.790
I'll trouble you all

42:20.790 --> 42:22.050
to sign and stamp this,

42:22.300 --> 42:23.730
so I can take it back

42:23.750 --> 42:25.410
and report back to King Xiang.

42:31.500 --> 42:34.850
[Military Order]

42:41.650 --> 42:42.460
Sir,

42:42.810 --> 42:45.140
you can press down at the end of the scroll.

43:02.350 --> 43:03.630
Mr. Zhuo,

43:03.650 --> 43:05.650
there are people behind you, right?

43:13.860 --> 43:15.260
There's one more person.

43:17.940 --> 43:19.210
She won't need to.

43:19.420 --> 43:21.200
I just heard her say

43:21.330 --> 43:23.860
she refuses to join the Demon Hunting Bureau.

43:24.170 --> 43:26.570
The Demon Hunting Bureau is truly useless.

43:26.770 --> 43:29.050
Even the dogs that our Chongwu Camp doesn't want

43:29.050 --> 43:31.180
look down on the Demon Hunting Bureau.

43:51.020 --> 43:52.200
[Military Order]

43:53.680 --> 43:55.880
Did you hear any dogs barking?

43:56.790 --> 43:57.870
It's a bit noisy.

44:08.140 --> 44:09.400
They're finally gone.

44:09.950 --> 44:11.140
Indeed.

44:12.770 --> 44:15.540
It's a pity the evidence of Chongwu Camp's crimes was burned.

44:15.540 --> 44:16.810
The real evidence

44:17.070 --> 44:18.410
was secretly sent

44:18.580 --> 44:20.640
to the Prime Minister the day before.

44:20.800 --> 44:22.790
If one day they really need to be held accountable,

44:22.790 --> 44:25.190
the Prime Minister will make the decision.

44:25.500 --> 44:26.680
The chance to investigate

44:26.680 --> 44:28.810
the Water Ghost case didn't come easy.

44:29.400 --> 44:31.160
Whether the Demon Hunting Bureau can be revitalized

44:31.160 --> 44:32.960
depends on this crucial battle.

44:34.720 --> 44:35.610
Zhao Yuanzhou,

44:35.640 --> 44:37.500
you'd better not play any tricks.

44:37.710 --> 44:38.700
Mr. Zhuo,

44:39.680 --> 44:40.760
trust me.

44:41.350 --> 44:42.550
Keep dreaming.

45:15.110 --> 45:17.710
These are all the files on the Water Ghost case.

45:18.230 --> 45:20.230
Everyone, please take a look first.

45:23.170 --> 45:25.700
[Military Order]

45:31.730 --> 45:32.570
Sir,

45:32.600 --> 45:34.930
you can press down at the end of the scroll.

45:46.080 --> 45:48.830
[Military Order]

45:51.430 --> 45:52.250
[Military Order]

